  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "msg_0117_D37R0102_00000",
      "en_US": [
        "Hello, dear.\r",
        "I sell inexpensive herbal medicine.\n",
        "They’re good, but a trifle bitter.\r",
        "Your Pokémon may not like them.\n",
        "Hehehehe... {YESNO 0}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0117_D37R0102_00001",
      "en_US": [
        "Hiya! Care to see some bargains?\r",
        "I sell rare items that nobody else\n",
        "carries--but only one of\f",
        "each item. {YESNO 0}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0117_D37R0102_00002",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 8, 0, 0} costs\n",
        "${STRVAR_1 53, 1, 0}. Want it?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0117_D37R0102_00003",
      "en_US": "Thanks.\r"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0117_D37R0102_00004",
      "en_US": [
        "You put the {STRVAR_1 8, 0, 0} in\n",
        "the {STRVAR_1 18, 1, 0} Pocket. {YESNO 0}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0117_D37R0102_00005",
      "en_US": [
        "You bought that already. I’m all\n",
        "sold out of it. {YESNO 0}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0117_D37R0102_00006",
      "en_US": "Uh-oh, you’re short on funds. {YESNO 0}"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0117_D37R0102_00007",
      "en_US": "Uh-oh, your Bag is chock-full. {YESNO 0}"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0117_D37R0102_00008",
      "en_US": "We’re closed for the day."
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0117_D37R0102_00009",
      "en_US": "Come by again sometime."
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0117_D37R0102_00010",
      "en_US": [
        "Welcome!\r",
        "I run the Pokémon Salon!\r",
        "I’m the older and better of the two\n",
        "Haircut Brothers.\r",
        "I can make your Pokémon beautiful for\n",
        "just $500.\r",
        "Grooming gives a better look.\n",
        "Your Pokémon will become friendlier and\f",
        "more beautiful.\r",
        "Would you like me to do that? {YESNO 0}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0117_D37R0102_00011",
      "en_US": "Which Pokémon should I work on?"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0117_D37R0102_00012",
      "en_US": "OK! Watch it become beautiful!"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0117_D37R0102_00013",
      "en_US": "There! All done!"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0117_D37R0102_00014",
      "en_US": "Is that right? That’s a shame!"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0117_D37R0102_00015",
      "en_US": "You’ll need more money than that."
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0117_D37R0102_00016",
      "en_US": [
        "I do only one haircut a day, sorry.\n",
        "I’m done for today."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0117_D37R0102_00017",
      "en_US": [
        "Welcome to the Pokémon Salon!\r",
        "I’m the younger and less expensive of\n",
        "the two Haircut Brothers.\r",
        "I’ll spruce up your Pokémon for\n",
        "just $300.\r",
        "Grooming gives a better look.\n",
        "Your Pokémon will become friendlier and\f",
        "more beautiful.\r",
        "So? How about it?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0117_D37R0102_00018",
      "en_US": "OK, which Pokémon should I spruce up?"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0117_D37R0102_00019",
      "en_US": "OK! I hope I do a good job!"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0117_D37R0102_00020",
      "en_US": "There we go! All done!"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0117_D37R0102_00021",
      "en_US": "No? How disappointing!"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0117_D37R0102_00022",
      "en_US": "You’re a little short on funds."
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0117_D37R0102_00023",
      "en_US": [
        "I have a feeling that it won’t go well\n",
        "next time. Let me close for the day!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0117_D37R0102_00024",
      "en_US": "{STRVAR_1 0, 0, 0} looks a little happier."
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0117_D37R0102_00025",
      "en_US": "{STRVAR_1 0, 0, 0} looks happy."
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0117_D37R0102_00026",
      "en_US": "{STRVAR_1 0, 0, 0} looks delighted!"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0117_D37R0102_00027",
      "en_US": "NO ENTRY BEYOND THIS POINT"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0117_D37R0102_00028",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} inserted the\n",
        "Basement Key.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0117_D37R0102_00029",
      "en_US": [
        "Welcome to the Memorial Photo Studio.\n",
        "We are no ordinary studio!\r",
        "You can wear a Team Rocket uniform\n",
        "to take a picture!\r",
        "Would you like to try it? {YESNO 0}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0117_D37R0102_00030",
      "en_US": [
        "Please stand in front of the camera\n",
        "once you have changed.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0117_D37R0102_00031",
      "en_US": [
        "Are you ready?\r",
        "Come on!\n",
        "Look cool as if you own the world!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0117_D37R0102_00032",
      "en_US": [
        "Good job.\r",
        "You can check the picture using the PC."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0117_D37R0102_00033",
      "en_US": [
        "You can wear a Team Rocket uniform\n",
        "to take a picture!\r",
        "Would you like to try it? {YESNO 0}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0117_D37R0102_00034",
      "en_US": [
        "...Fair enough.\r",
        "No one should look up to Team Rocket."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0117_D37R0102_00035",
      "en_US": [
        "Hmm. Your Photo Album is full.\r",
        "Access your PC and delete\n",
        "some pictures."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0117_D37R0102_00036",
      "en_US": [
        "Huh?\n",
        "Are you a newcomer, too?\r",
        "We had to recruit new members for the\n",
        "Radio Tower mission.\f",
        "Then we ran out of uniforms.\r",
        "I heard this studio has some, so I\n",
        "decided to “borrow” one.\r",
        "Since you are here, why don’t you\n",
        "change as well?\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0117_D37R0102_00037",
      "en_US": [
        "Look at you! Pretty good!\r",
        "Oh, but you shouldn’t try to scare\n",
        "people walking around looking\f",
        "like that, OK?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0117_D37R0102_00038",
      "garbage": 58
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0117_D37R0102_00039",
      "en_US": [
        "Ooh, your Pokémon are so very\n",
        "charming! How enchanting!\r",
        "If you dress up your Pokémon here,\n",
        "make it a sight to behold!\r",
        "Then I will even hang a picture of one\n",
        "in the other room!\r",
        "You will do this, won’t you? {YESNO 0}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0117_D37R0102_00040",
      "en_US": [
        "Oh, you silly thing...\n",
        "Where’s your sense of adventure?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0117_D37R0102_00041",
      "en_US": [
        "Ooh, ooh, yes! How nice!\n",
        "Let’s not delay!\r",
        "Should I explain to you how\n",
        "to dress up your Pokémon? {YESNO 0}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0117_D37R0102_00042",
      "en_US": [
        "Ooh, I wonder which Pokémon you’ll\n",
        "dress up?\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0117_D37R0102_00043",
      "en_US": [
        "Teeheehee...\n",
        "I hope you will dress it up adorably!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0117_D37R0102_00044",
      "en_US": [
        "You have a Fashion Case, don’t you?\n",
        "Ah, oui, wonderful!\r",
        "Just choose the Accessories and put\n",
        "them on your Pokémon.\r",
        "When you’re done, I will snap a photo\n",
        "and put it up beside me!\r",
        "If you mix your records with others,\n",
        "you can get their photos, too!\r",
        "I think it will be much easier if \n",
        "you will just try! {YESNO 0}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0117_D37R0102_00045",
      "en_US": [
        "Ooh, nice work!\n",
        "Let’s display the photo right away!\f",
        "Oh, but it needs to have a title!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0117_D37R0102_00046",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 28, 0, 0}...\r",
        "Ooh, yes, yes! I get it now!\n",
        "Your aesthetics shine through!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0117_D37R0102_00047",
      "en_US": [
        "Oh, non, non, non!\n",
        "It will be forlorn without a title.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0117_D37R0102_00048",
      "en_US": [
        "Oh... You came out without doing\n",
        "anything... How disappointing."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0117_D37R0102_00049",
      "en_US": [
        "If you dress up any Pokémon again,\n",
        "the photo here will be changed.\r",
        "Would you like to dress up\n",
        "a Pokémon, dearie? {YESNO 0}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0117_D37R0102_00050",
      "en_US": [
        "Why don’t I dress up myself and hang a\n",
        "picture...?\r",
        "The title should be...\n",
        "Hmm...how about “Girl’s Paradise”?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0117_D37R0102_00051",
      "en_US": [
        "Ooh, non, non, non! That’s an Egg!\n",
        "It’s too young to be dressing up!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0117_D37R0102_00052",
      "en_US": [
        "I put your photo up right here.\n",
        "It just looks so perfect there!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0117_D37R0102_00053",
      "en_US": [
        "It’s a frame for holding a\n",
        "portrait photo."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0117_D37R0102_00054",
      "garbage": 93
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0117_D37R0102_00055",
      "en_US": [
        "Team Rocket members in black suits\n",
        "have been running around...\r",
        "I was wondering what was going on.\n",
        "So, you took on Team Rocket?\f",
        "You are impressive!\r",
        "You may be able to face the\n",
        "legendary Poké...\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0117_D37R0102_00056",
      "en_US": [
        "Hahaha! Never mind.\r",
        "I must go now.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0117_D37R0102_00057",
      "en_US": [
        "Take a look!\r",
        "This is a drawing for Accessories.\n",
        "You never know what you’re gonna get.\r",
        "Would you like to try for $100? {YESNO 0}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0117_D37R0102_00058",
      "en_US": [
        "Wow, you are great!\n",
        "So many Accessories and wallpapers!\r",
        "Go ahead and dress up your Pokémon!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0117_D37R0102_00059",
      "en_US": "Please come again!"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0117_D37R0102_00060",
      "en_US": [
        "Oh, no!\n",
        "You’re short on funds."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0117_D37R0102_00061",
      "en_US": [
        "Here we go!\r",
        "..................\n",
        "..................\f",
        "......\f",
        "You win!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0117_D37R0102_00062",
      "en_US": "How about a wallpaper?\r"
